```
Reason:
The fix introduces an atomic check using `ATOMIC_COMPARE_EXCHANGE_BOOL` to determine if an SDP offer/answer exchange has already occurred. This ensures that if an offer has already been processed, any subsequent offers from the same client ID are ignored, thus preventing the system from incorrectly handling multiple offers for the same session.


